  "description": "Engaged Orange Squeezer feedback compressor, reconstructed from the 2012-01-12 General Guitar Gadgets original-reference drawing and cross-checked with DryBell DM1044. Bias sets the Q2 source voltage. The model uses a selected 2N5457 gain-control JFET and a 1N34A as the 1N100 detector. Source: https://generalguitargadgets.com/pdf/ggg_osq_sc_original.pdf",
  "groundNode": "0",
  "inputNode": "in",
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Volume",
      "Bias"
    ]
  },
  "name": "Dan Armstrong Orange Squeezer",
  "outputNode": "out",
  "version": 3,
